ine, funding routes, language evidence, documents and official application sources.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/design/china/china-7-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-19\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-19\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/xiamen-university-admissions-scholarships/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When do XMU 2027 master’s applications open?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The published guide starts applications on 1 December 2026. Different scholarship categories have different closing dates.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does 31 May apply to CSC?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. In the reviewed master’s guide, 31 May 2027 is the self-funded deadline; the listed university CSC route closes earlier.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does XMU accept alternatives to IELTS?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The reviewed master’s guide includes alternative English-language evidence. Check the exact degree and programme conditions before relying on it.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L19"}],false,"$L1a","$L1b"]}]
